  itemID: journal1
  itemName: 'Valentino''s Journal - Entry 1 (of 5) '
  itemType: 1
  icon: {fileID: -811217553, guid: 44bb429c66c7df816b55d41878254ce0, type: 3}
  description: 
  fileText: '"I have been watching her perform for six months. She doesn''t know
    I arranged for her to be hired. That''s not something I can tell her now - or
    perhaps ever. What I arranged seemed like a kindness at the time. Now I''m not
    sure what it was."'
